			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1894658">
									

<p>Hello, as this stands, it is just a truck that is also organic. It didn't really interest me through the weirdness aspect as the foundation already has several &quot;objects that shouldn't be organic, but are&quot;.</p>
<p>Where you put that agitating it makes it [DATA EXPUNGED] and then hinted at what that means, I liked that, but you only have one line of emphasis on it and then the report just abruptly ends.</p>
<p>I feel that there is a problem with tone where you say &quot;it walks with wave-like lurching motions, somewhat like those of an earthworm.&quot; The foundation doesn't usually make subjective similes. If it moves a certain way, just state that it moves a certain way.</p>
<p>I'd be willing to change my vote if it had more oomph</p>

